{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1457553-claw-strider-cavalry","id":1457553,"title":"Claw Strider Cavalry?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-23T23:45:58-07:00","id":1457553,"title":"Claw Strider Cavalry?","content":"Hello all, I was just wondering if a group of characters lets just say 3 players with one of them being a Lunar shapeshifted into a Claw Strider, the other riding another claw strider. This would provide the maximum 3 success bonus for Pack Hunting correct? This just seems very powerful for a group of close combat characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-24T13:39:06-07:00","id":1457594,"title":"","content":"I refer you to Lunars page 134 sidebar at the top. That definitely seems like it\u2019s overpowered to the point of making things less fun at your table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","user":"DrLoveMonkey","date":". 08-24-2021, 04:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-26T11:41:55-07:00","id":1457723,"title":"","content":"Note that if you use the claw strider's bite, you are limited to an Accuracy 1, Damage 15, OVW 1 attack, when an artifact weapon will give you somewhere between accuracy 1, damage 14+strength, OVW 5 and accuracy 5, damage 10+strength, OVW 3<br /> 3 successes brings that to effectively accuracy 7, except that it uses up most of your dice cap. So, depending on your strength it's better than a light artifact weapon by 2 accuracy and 0-4 damage, but loses dice cap, overwhelming, and tags.<br /> Using the claws is complicated, but it's accuracy at least 1, only those count as charm dice so you hit the dice cap much faster - someone with dex 5, brawl 3 is already at the charm cap just from being a claw strider if they stunt another attribute 5 in. And you're down to damage 11, as bad as a light weapon with str 1<br /> You also lose out on the option for a medium weapon's defense boost, which is 1 non-charm success to defense, which is similar in value to a non-charm success to attacks<br /> <br /> Also pack hunting applies to decisive which weapon stats don't<br /> <br /> Though, if you get your hands on a way to use constructed weapon stats in animal form instead of natural weapons non of this applies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}